<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Horizon Group cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Horizon Group cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- JP Morgan analyst Lee Schalop said he cut his rating on Horizon Group Inc to market performer from buy citing lower rent growth from a few weak properties and increased tenant demands, the high cost of capital and lower returns from new developments.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/8 at 21.</p>
</text>
